@startuml get-manager-business-card-graduated-pk
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/business-card/{graduatedPk}
caption CRB-44 · 명함 이미지 presigned GET URL 발급. 열람 기록을 먼저 남기고, 저장에 실패하면 URL을 발급하지 않음

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "BusinessCardController" as Controller
participant "BusinessCardService" as Service
participant "AdminGraduatedRepository" as AdminGraduatedRepository
participant "AdminAccessLogRepository" as AdminAccessLogRepository
participant "FileService" as FileService
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/business-card/{graduatedPk}\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found\nadmin · superadmin 모두 가능
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt graduatedPk가 UUID가 아님
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (ParseUUIDPipe 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: getImageUrl(graduatedPk, manager)
Controller -> Service: getImageUrl(graduatedPk, manager)

Service -> AdminGraduatedRepository: findCardByPk(graduatedPk)
AdminGraduatedRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT g.business_card_key FROM graduated g JOIN users u\nWHERE g.pk = ? AND u.is_deleted = false
PostgreSQL --> AdminGraduatedRepository: row | 0행
alt 현업자 없음 (탈퇴 처리 완료 포함)
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 Graduated not found
else business_card_key = NULL (미업로드 · 인증 취소)
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 Business card not found
end

Service -> AdminAccessLogRepository: insert({ adminEmail, targetType: "business_card", targetId: graduatedPk })
AdminAccessLogRepository -> PostgreSQL: INSERT INTO admin_access_log
note right
  users · graduated로 FK를 걸지 않아 탈퇴 삭제(purge)를 막지 않음.
  트랜잭션 없이 이 INSERT 하나만 씀.
  QueryLogWriter가 이 테이블의 쿼리 파라미터(이메일)를 로그에서 가림
end note
alt 기록 저장 실패
  PostgreSQL --> AdminAccessLogRepository: 오류
  AdminAccessLogRepository -[#red]-> Client: 500 An unexpected error occurred. (URL 발급 안 함, Slack 알림)
end

Service -> FileService: getPresignedUrl(key, 60)
note right of FileService: 서버에서 서명만 계산 (S3 호출 없음).\n만료 60초. URL과 key는 로그에 남기지 않음
alt 서명 실패 (기록은 남음: 시도까지 기록)
  FileService -[#red]-> Client: 500 Internal Server Error
end
FileService --> Service: url
Service --> Controller: BusinessCardImageUrlDto
Controller --> Client: 200 { url, expires_in: 60 }

@enduml
